  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1007.05 Posting the License. The license shall be posted in a conspicuous place by the licensee on the premises described in the license.\n\nSource. #8526, eff 12-21-05; ss by #10536, eff 3-6-14; ss by #13049, eff 6-4-20 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 1000); ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1008.05) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
